1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Salardagi hidni yo'qotish uchun

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,080
jami 9,5 milliard so'm

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,780
sarflanganligi aytilmoqda.

4
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:05,780
Shu yil yozda

5
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,740
tozalash hovuzlari germetik yopildi

6
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,140
va ichidagi havo sorbent,

7
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,220
ultrabinafsha nur va ko'mirdan o'tkazildi.

8
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,040
Mutasaddilarning aytishicha,

9
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,980
vodorod sulfid miqdori nolga tushgan.

10
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,300
Lekin hali muammo hal bo'lmadi.

11
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,540
Bu uskuna faqat havoni tozalaydi,

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,100
suvni emas.

13
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,560
Suvni yaroqli holatda

14
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:24,060
qishloq xo'jaligiga berishdan oldin

15
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,040
har bir korxona

16
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,520
chiqayotgan oqovasini tozalab,

17
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,120
keyin bu yerga jo'natishi kerak.

18
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,800
Har bir zavod uchun

19
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,000
suvdagi kimyoviy moddalarni

20
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,260
oqova chiqarishda me'yor belgilangan.

21
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,200
Va ular mana shu me'yorga

22
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,680
amal qilishlari kerak bo'ladi.

23
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,900
Menimcha, mana shunda

24
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:40,380
muammoni hal qilsa bo'ladi.

25
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,940
Bizni kuzatishda davom eting,

26
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,760
suv haqida suvyektiv fikrlaymiz!
